# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <body>
#
# <footer>
#
# ── Conventional Commits ── https://www.conventionalcommits.org
#
# type   (required): feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|perf|test|build|ci|chore|revert
# scope  (optional): area of change. e.g. (parse) (box) (io)
# subject(required): imperative, present tense. <= 50 chars. No trailing period.
#
# body   (optional): what and why. Wrap at 72 chars. Leave the "how" to the code.
#
# footer (optional):
#   Breaking change -> BREAKING CHANGE: <description>   (or `!` after type/scope)
#   Issue reference -> Refs: #123 / Closes: #123
#
# Examples:
#   feat(parse): add resumable box iteration
#   fix(io): correct offset calculation at box boundaries
#   feat(parse)!: change the box iterator return type
#
#   BREAKING CHANGE: `BoxReader::next` now yields `Result<Box>` instead of `Box`
